DoFAdminTools here is the Bannerlord 1.5.x build from the unofficial fork:
  https://github.com/fiefevictionnotice/dofadmintools  (fork of https://gitlab.com/Krex/dofadmintools)
Original work by Krex, MIT license (modules/DoFAdminTools/LICENSE). Thank you to Krex for having this mod open source.

The fork only adds 1.5.x compatibility (see the fork notice at the top of modules/DoFAdminTools/readme.md).
To update: build the fork (dotnet build -c Release, with the BLSERVER environment variable pointing at a 1.5.x
dedicated server folder) and copy bin/Release/DoFAdminTools/* plus LICENSE and README.md (as readme.md) into
modules/DoFAdminTools.
If Krex releases an official 1.5.x version, switch back to his release.
(The old "git subtree pull ... dof master" route pulls Krex's 1.3 source, which does not build or run on 1.5.x.)
